use kindred77/vcpkg branch-2025.6.13-msvc-my_gporca
with x64-windows-static-md triplet

Use visual studio toolchains in Clion, and add cmake options below:
-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug
-DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=E:/mywork/projects/cpp/vcpkg/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake
-DVELOX_ENABLE_DUCKDB=OFF
-DVELOX_BUILD_TEST_UTILS=OFF
-DVELOX_BUILD_TESTING=OFF
-DVELOX_ENABLE_TPCH_CONNECTOR=OFF
-DVELOX_ENABLE_TPCDS_CONNECTOR=OFF
-DVELOX_ENABLE_ICEBERG_FUNCTIONS=OFF
-DVELOX_ENABLE_PARQUET=ON
-DVELOX_ENABLE_GEO=OFF
-DVCPKG_MANIFEST_DIR=E:/mywork/projects/cpp/velox/windows/vcpkg
-DVCPKG_TARGET_TRIPLET=x64-windows-static-md
-DVCPKG_MANIFEST_INSTALL=OFF
-DVCPKG_INSTALLED_DIR=E:/mywork/projects/cpp/vcpkg/installed
-DFLEX_INCLUDE_DIR=E:/mywork/projects/cpp/velox/velox/expression/signature_parser/generated
-DVELOX_MONO_LIBRARY=OFF

If you want to build in cmd.exe,
call "D:\software\Microsoft Visual Studio\2022\Community\VC\Auxiliary\Build\vcvarsall.bat x64" first.
then cmake:
  "D:\software\Microsoft Visual Studio\2022\Community\Common7\IDE\CommonExtensions\Microsoft\CMake\CMake\bin\cmake.exe" -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug
    -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=E:/mywork/projects/cpp/vcpkg/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake
    -DVELOX_ENABLE_DUCKDB=OFF -DVELOX_BUILD_TEST_UTILS=OFF -DVELOX_BUILD_TESTING=OFF
    -DMSVC_TOOLCHAIN=TRUE -DVELOX_ENABLE_TPCH_CONNECTOR=OFF -DVELOX_ENABLE_TPCDS_CONNECTOR=OFF
    -DVELOX_ENABLE_ICEBERG_FUNCTIONS=OFF -DVELOX_ENABLE_PARQUET=OFF -DVELOX_ENABLE_GEO=OFF
    -DVCPKG_MANIFEST_DIR=E:/mywork/projects/cpp/velox/windows/vcpkg
    -DVCPKG_TARGET_TRIPLET=x64-windows-static-md
    -DVCPKG_MANIFEST_INSTALL=OFF
    -DVELOX_MONO_LIBRARY=OFF
    -DVCPKG_INSTALLED_DIR=E:/mywork/projects/cpp/vcpkg/installed
    -DFLEX_INCLUDE_DIR=E:/mywork/projects/cpp/velox/velox/expression/signature_parser/generated
    -G Ninja -S E:\mywork\projects\cpp\velox -B E:\mywork\projects\cpp\velox\cmake-build-debug-vs2022

then build with ninja.

In Clion, you should use the VS toolchains, with amd64 Architecture and Empty platform.


In linux, you should download folly_v2026.01.05.00,libstemmer_c-2.2.0,protobuf-3.21.7,simdjson-4.1.0 and put them in thirdpart_libs with velox source building option.
